direction: down
title: "C23 PutObjs custody and cache incarnation"
"Post-push 1201" -> "Local count401": "stable owner record exists; reserve800 uncredited responsibility"
"Local count401" -> "Walk 401 links": "load head; assign last then read next; preserve phase and cursor"
"Walk 401 links" -> "Cut local prefix": "only walk==401; retained401 and batch800"
"Cut local prefix" -> "Shared mutex known": "unknown acquisition retains lock/cache custody"
"Shared mutex known" -> "Batch head visible": "old tail link then shared head; count still old"
"Batch head visible" -> "Shared count800 credited": "empty-list tail branch then count increment"
"Shared count800 credited" -> "Mutex released": "unknown release retains duty; never guess unlocked"
"Mutex released" -> "Local lastPtr fixed": "same native owner; reentry still excluded"
"Local lastPtr fixed" -> "PutObjs receipt": "independent protected release publication; not entire free receipt"
"Any uncertain cut" -> "Stable supervisor": "no replay; preserve phase/cursor/batch/lock/source lease"
"PutObjs receipt" -> "Closed cache admission": "drain readers and qualify all finalization callers"
"Closed cache admission" -> "New generation": "cache address may be reused; old opaque receipt stays stale"
"Mutex released" -> "Other thread consumes batch": "TclThreadAllocObj/MoveObjs may reuse objects before local lastPtr; no old-tail dereference"
